{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">現年71歲的陳榮峻，近年憑藉處境劇《愛·回家之開心速遞》中「譚道德」一角深受觀眾喜愛，與戲裡戲外皆是夫妻的吳香倫（飾演譚何容儀）雙雙成功入屋。日前，兩人獲邀出席內地一個電影節，攜手盛裝亮相成為焦點。</p><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"></h3><p style=\"text-align: left;\">活動當晚，陳榮峻身穿一襲灰色中山裝，並巧妙地搭配了精緻胸針，整體狀態極佳；吳香倫以一身黑色優雅套裝同行，氣質高貴。兩人在活動期間全程形影不離，高調放閃大曬恩愛。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"24b0e035-8434-40dc-8892-5275e2d9badb.jpeg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026GpkwTwfDV31789033272.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"24b0e035-8434-40dc-8892-5275e2d9badb.jpeg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"4f9b6628-b08d-4ab6-bc41-61d15f6df34f.jpeg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026TC8JpOtkbu1789033271.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"4f9b6628-b08d-4ab6-bc41-61d15f6df34f.jpeg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"></h3><p style=\"text-align: left;\">難得出席大型盛會並與多位圈中好友同場，陳榮峻亦把握機會，帶著太太四出「集郵」打卡。他們先後與多位資深影視藝人合照敘舊，當中包括趙雅芝、任達華、鍾鎮濤、鄧萃雯、林曉峰。這番互動不僅場面熱鬧溫馨，更充分展現了陳榮峻與吳香倫在圈中的超好人緣。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-10T09:59:42.250505+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":299,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}